 your boss in Lubyanka is practically the Stasi's running dog at this point.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Might not be the best choice of words, but that's pretty much how it is.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This system named \"Bee Sting\" is essentially a real-time surveillance system.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But my boss in Germany has recently discovered that there's someone else behind it.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Paradeus.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Indeed...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is this why you insisted on being the first to meet me in Germany?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes. The \"sparrow\" by Ulrich's side... has long been transparent.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange, we can work together.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":21,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...This whole thing is so laughable I don't even know what to say.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":21,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It may look like a sports car, but the wheels are manually pushed by four men hiding underneath. That's the truth with many new inventions.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How do I hide from the surveillance system?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't. It's impossible.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Which is why I'm taking such a big risk meeting you in person. This information can only come straight from me to you.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Anything remote, they'll see.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If there are any unknown personnel around you, or if you communicate via an unencrypted channel, they'll see.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":21,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just to be clear, I have no desire to get involved in the Stasi's infighting.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Relax. I'll handle K.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Back when we were in training, I always beat him in everything.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":21,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":21,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's why he is only good enough to work under a \"little sheep\" like the incumbent director.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What, you're sure that the boss you're betting on will get ahead?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Absolutely.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What is the basis of your judgment?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"My mission reimbursement is three times K's.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who is this \"sparrow\" by Ulrich's side?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her secretary, Morridow. She's what they call a Nyto.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After swallowing the last bite of her brownie, Q gets to her feet and picks up the most expensive record on display."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-maya","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Agent Q","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You get the bill this time. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My treat next time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":19,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Q looks at the speechless Ange and smiles. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then she turns and takes her leave, disappearing silently beyond the shelves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange is left on her own."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
